/* ---- b008: ONLINE-IFACE-A v2 leaderboards (§2.2) over LB_GET / LB_RANGE / LB_UPDATE (ONLINE-PROTOCOL §5) ----
 * Tickets: non-blocking like the rest of the interface. PS3 sent leaderboard-get in commands of 16 names (f_328ae8); the same
 * 16-name chunks are sent here, each its own request, and the ticket completes when every chunk has answered. A failed or
 * lost connection completes pending tickets with -1 (PS3: a query that cannot connect has no effect). */
