/* ===== agent K k001 (1): Play Online goes straight to the online lobby with the active profile (user request) =====
 * PS3 1.19 Play Online (f_296628, PS4 callback 0x66e500, kind 90 -> onb_play_online) runs NetInit(user, LAN 0) at once with the
 * signed-in PSN user: there is no LAN profile page on the online path (PAGE_LAN_CHOOSE_PROFILE 0x4608c1ad is opened only by the
 * LAN choice f_27fdf0). b014/b044 opened the LAN profile page first because the community sign-in needs a name. Now the
 * active profile (the last one picked, s->profiles.selected, saved in the profile store; the first one when none is saved) is
 * the identity and begin_startup runs directly: Connecting popup (b043), NetInit, online lobby. At the end of the startup the
 * page under the lobby is the page Play Online came from (PAGE_MULTIPLAYER_CHOICE 0x1e66a744 / PAGE_COOP_CHOICE 0xb0e67b0e)
 * instead of the profile page, as on PS3 (Connecting -> lobby above the choice page). With no profile yet (empty store) or a
 * damaged store the profile page still opens (a name is needed). LAN Party keeps its profile page.
 * Switch U3MP_ONLINE_SKIP_PROFILE=0 (byte rw2+0x4059 bit0): the profile page again. k01_d: [0] direct starts, [1] fallbacks to
 * the profile page (no profile / store error / startup busy), [2] profile used (1-based), [3] origin page. */
